              <li><a href="https://doc.biblissima.fr/formation-iiif/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Module de formation à IIIF — Module de formation de Biblissima+</a> (FR disponible)</li>
              <li><a href="https://collections.library.utoronto.ca/explore/faq/getting_started" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reusing Collections of U of T Items with IIIF — University of Toronto</a></li>
